# The Xcode a release is built with (M23 §4C.3). Read by:
#   - CI's Xcode 27 job: its `xcodebuild -version` build must equal EXPECTED_RELEASE_XCODE_BUILD,
#     so the toolchain that builds the shipped binary is the one CI ran every gate on;
#   - scripts/release-preflight.sh, before archiving: the local `xcodebuild -version` build must
#     equal it (a mismatch refuses at once and prints the two ways out);
#   - scripts/verify-archive.sh: the app's and each appex's DTXcodeBuild must equal it, and
#     DTSDKName must be at least MIN_SDK.
# Bump EXPECTED_RELEASE_XCODE_BUILD only in a commit whose CI ran on the new build.
EXPECTED_RELEASE_XCODE_BUILD=27B52
MIN_SDK=iphoneos26
